# K03 NS-ROLES-2 (Codex K03-NS-ROLES-2-20261007-20; docs/LMX_semantics.en.md#resolved-head-consumption,
# #declaration-visibility): a named Structure's body takes the common roles of the root and a method.
# merge's into-pair (the author's merge rule, plan §4): Model's and Other's `at` both reference Point -- one type:
# Other's at goes INTO Model's slot.  Exit 7; 81 if R's at did not read Point's x.
Point:
    size_t: x 3U
end: Point
Model:
    at: Point
end: Model
Other:
    at: Point
end: Other
fn: m () int
    R: merge: Model Other
    if: R\at\x != 3U
        return: 81
    return: 7
end: m
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: m(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
